        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Katsudon is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "donburi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "donburi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " that layers a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "panko ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "panko"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "-crusted pork cutlet over rice with egg and onion cooked in a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "dashi",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dashi"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " broth. The cutlet stays crispy on top while the broth soaks into the rice below. Serves 4."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fry the cutlets just before serving so the coating stays crunchy. The egg should be barely set when you plate the bowl."
          }
        ]
      },
